---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Ant Control Victoria TX | Fire Ants & Household Ants" description="Professional ant control in Victoria, TX. Fire ants, carpenter ants, sugar ants and more. Fast, effective treatments for homes and yards.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Services → Ant Control</div>
      <h1>Ant Control in Victoria, TX</h1>
      <p>Eliminate trails, nests and colonies — not just the ants you see on the counter.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Common Ants in the Victoria Area</h2>
      <p>Fire ants, Argentine ants, odorous house ants, carpenter ants and pavement ants all thrive in South Texas. Each species behaves differently and requires the right approach.</p>
      <h2>Our Ant Control Approach</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Identify the species and locate nesting sites</li>
        <li>Treat trails and entry points</li>
        <li>Target outdoor colonies that feed indoor populations</li>
        <li>Use baits and residual products appropriate for the species</li>
        <li>Advise on moisture and food sources that attract ants</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Fire Ants</h2>
      <p>Fire ant mounds in the yard are more than a nuisance — they are a safety hazard for kids and pets. We treat individual mounds and can include yard-wide fire ant programs when needed.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Get Ant Control Today</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
